[
  {
    tag: "game",
    schema: 0.1,
    title: _("Winds of Fate"),
    children: [
      {
        tag: "map",
        id: "scenario_06x_Winds_of_Fate",
        file: "winds-of-fate-06x.generated.map",
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_3",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_4",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/trow_intro_02.webp"),
            text: _("The hunt continued across grassy stretches of the Greatland. Prey was harvested in countless numbers. Finally, overburdened with the yield of the hunt, Flight Gorlack returned to its eyrie. The recently arrived Flight of Vladnir awaited them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_5",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I come with tidings, fellow dominant. Half of Morogor makes ready for the journey here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_6",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ That must not be. Even now we have not the provisions for them. Further, our saurians tell us there is a grim season which afflicts the Greatland. Much of it will grow as cold as a high mountain peak. This cold lasts several moons."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_7",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Nothing will delay their coming. All that before stirred one flight against another, now drives them here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_8",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Then their needs will be met. I shall expand the hunt so as to meet them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_9",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Gorlack, you must reconsider this course, wholly. End the hunt. Elsewise... you doom this expedition by following the shameful Windpath of Dominant Morogor."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_10",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I see your sense has yet to return, Resha! Dominant Morogor betrayed his own kith; he attacked the very drakes with whom he had sworn alliance!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_11",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Nay, they were not drakes which he attacked... Those allies Morogor betrayed were creatures of an alien kind. Perhaps even the same kind our hunters now chase across the grassy flatland. I should have long ago Spoken the whole of this Memory to you. Yet I had concern it was more than you could believe by word alone."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_12",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Then your concern was well measured, for I disbelieve you even now. Those ‘humans’ that graze upon the tall grass of the flatland, that trick beasts to carry them across it, that ride works of driftwood over the sea, can be of no consequence to our affairs. No Ancestor would mistake such simple <i>prey</i> for an ally."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_13",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Yet verily it was so. Drakes once counted many noble creatures as allies in times of need — the fleetfoot, the drakekin, the craftlings, the serpents, the casters. Likewise were there those of terrible natures — the Horde, the Jotnar... the Faerie. I fear one of these races is they who swept our folk from this Greatland long ago."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_14",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The names which they call themselves have shifted in our long absence. Yet many creatures we have already come across bear a perfect likeness to those from the Spoken Memories. Indeed they are the same. If we proceed as we have, we shall drive old allies to war against us. Worse still, we may awaken an ancient foe to our presence in this land."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_15",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Your first intendant speaks truth, Dominant Gorlack. By the Honor of my Caste in whole, I hereby Proclaim it so."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_16",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Dominant Vladnir... never since the exiling has another caste verified our Spoken Memories."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_17",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ We were forbidden to do so. Since the Time of Legend, we clashers have been charged with the keeping of secrets — The meandering way through the underland took by Parapathos in seeking the Council of Nine. Makings for the mighty Automata down to their metal hearts that mix fire into water. Witwegana’s final words of affection to her mate before delaying Lenvan with a hopeless duel. The wisdoms, the powers, the stories of our Ancestors. These were once shared freely among all drakes. Until, anguished by our exile, Dominant Morogor forbade their telling. Your glider caste alone would not comply. By our honor, we did. Yet our written secrets quietly remained."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_18",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Now, we are far beyond the Domain of Morogor; here his edicts hold no sway. All that he made secret, I may share with you here."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_19",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Speak no more of your secrets."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ ... Gorla—"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_21",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I see now how you all cling to your fragments of the past; you cower there with them. Clasher secrets. Glider memories. All useless, as an entire age passed while every one of you feared to act on what you knew!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_22",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Gorlack, the clasher secrets may bear details of the Greatland unknown to the Spoken Memories. If we do not heed them, I fear—"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_23",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Speak no more of your fears! So many challenges have we overcome. So many foes vanquished. Yet still you feel not how we shift the Winds by the force of our Will."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_24",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/hurricane.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ ... Gorlack, I grasp not your meaning. While the Spoken Memories tell us steady wings may catch the Winds of Fate—"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_25",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Nay! We are not merely tossed about by the Winds. We <b>shape</b> them. We fumble not for a Windpath. We make it. Feel the world as it should be with all the fire of your heart. With no room left for <i>fear</i>. With all your Willful heart, make that world be!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_26",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Perhaps you need witness one final demonstration..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_27",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ I Call the Hunt. A hunt greater than any before it. Three flights of hunters. I already signaled Karron to continue east across the Grassy Flatland. Vladnir, you will depart southeast for the Warmsands. I shall go northeast into the Wesmere Jungle. Together we shall provide enough for all of Morogor."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_28",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Then... so it will be..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _(""),
        defeat: _(""),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_2",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
